OL,5,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,6,     FGideon Coe chats to musician Nat
OL,7,     FBirchall about the impact of John
OL,8,     FColtrane around what would have
OL,9,     Fbeen his 100th birthday.
OL,10,G1300 Guy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,11,     FGuy sends birthday greetings to
OL,12,     FJR, Luke Skywalker and the man who
OL,13,     Fgave us Tar Macadam.
OL,14,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,15,     FJarvis takes listeners with him
OL,16,     Fwhilst he visits the sights and
OL,17,     Fsounds New York City. He hits
OL,18,     FCarnegie Hall, Max's, Radio City
OL,19,     FMusic Hall, the 59th Street Bridge
OL,20,     Fand the docks.
